msgid ""
"Applies ``textwrap.dedent`` to strip the common leading whitespace from "
"every line. If the first line ends with a line-continuation backslash and "
"still begins with whitespace after dedent (paste of a subproc command where "
"line 1 was indented deeper than the continuation line), also ``lstrip`` the "
"source so the first line is flush-left."
